  volume   =  28,
  number   =  4,
  pages    = "355--366",
  abstract = "Human skin progenitor cells will form new hair follicles, although
              at a low efficiency, when injected into nude mouse skin. To better
              study and improve upon this regenerative process, we developed an
              in vitro system to analyse the morphogenetic cell behaviour in
              detail and modulate physical-chemical parameters to more
