  number   =  3,
  pages    = "1303--1311",
  abstract = "Inspired by the patterns of multicellularity in choanoflagellates,
              the closest living relatives of animals, we quantify the
              biophysical processes underlying the morphogenesis of rosette
              colonies in the choanoflagellate Salpingoeca rosetta We find that
              rosettes reproducibly transition from an early stage of
