  volume   =  4,
  number   =  2,
  pages    = "184--193",
  abstract = "To investigate the mechanisms of persistent neural activity, we
              obtained in vivo intracellular recordings from neurons in an
              oculomotor neural integrator of the goldfish during spontaneous
              saccades and fixations. Persistent changes in firing rate
