  volume   =  18,
  number   =  1,
  pages    = "388--398",
  abstract = "Gamma frequency field oscillations (40-100 Hz) are nested within
              theta oscillations in the dentate-hilar and CA1-CA3 regions of the
              hippocampus during exploratory behaviors. These oscillations
              reflect synchronized synaptic potentials that entrain the
              discharge of neuronal populations within the approximately 10-25
