  volume   =  26,
  number   =  16,
  pages    = "4266--4276",
  abstract = "Electrophysiological recording studies in the dorsocaudal region
              of medial entorhinal cortex (dMEC) of the rat reveal cells whose
              spatial firing fields show a remarkably regular hexagonal grid
              pattern (Fyhn et al., 2004; Hafting et al., 2005). We describe a
