  number   =  4,
  pages    = "427--432",
  abstract = "The entorhinal region is an important center of the limbic system
              involved in many dementing disorders. The boundaries of the
              entorhinal region of the left and right hemispheres were
              investigated in tangential sections (5 individuals, age range 21
