  volume   =  13,
  number   =  1,
  pages    = "334--350",
  abstract = "How random is the discharge pattern of cortical neurons? We
              examined recordings from primary visual cortex (V1; Knierim and
              Van Essen, 1992) and extrastriate cortex (MT; Newsome et al.,
