  volume   =  16,
  number   =  9,
  pages    = "795--808",
  abstract = "The present review considers research on the hippocampus and
              related areas from humans and experimental animals and makes three
              main points. First, many of the anatomical details of the
              hippocampus and adjacent cortical areas in the parahippocampal
              region are conserved across mammals. Second, the functional role
