  journal  = "Eur. J. Neurosci.",
  volume   =  11,
  number   =  8,
  pages    = "2793--2800",
  abstract = "Synchronous oscillations of intracellular calcium concentration
              ([Ca2+](i)) and of membrane potential occurred in alimited
              population of glutamatergic hippocampal neurons grown in primary
              cultures. The oscillatory activityoccurred in synaptically
              connected cells only when they were in the presence of astrocytes.
