              oscillatory activity, provided that glial cells participated in
              thenetwork. The glutamate-transporter inhibitors
              L-trans-pyrrolidine-2,4-dicarboxylic acid (PDC) anddihydrokainate,
              which produce an accumulation of glutamate in the synaptic
