  author   = "Maeda, E and Robinson, H P and Kawana, A",
  journal  = "J. Neurosci.",
  volume   =  15,
  number   =  10,
  pages    = "6834--6845",
  abstract = "The characteristics and mechanisms of synchronized firing in
              developing networks of cultured cortical neurons were studied
              using multisite recording through planar electrode arrays (PEAs).
              With maturation of the network (from 3 to 40 d after plating), the
              frequency and propagation velocity of bursts increased markedly
              (approximately from 0.01 to 0.5 Hz and from 5 to 100 mm/sec,
