  volume   =  92,
  number   =  4,
  pages    = "1243--1259",
  abstract = "The physiological and morphological properties of interneurons in
              infragranular layers of rat visual cortex have been studied in
              organotypic cortex monocultures and thalamus-cortex co-cultures
              using intracellular recordings and biocytin injections. Cultures
