  volume   =  17,
  number   =  4,
  pages    = "929--952",
  abstract = "The activity of 53 antidromically identified abducens motoneurons
              was analyzed in alert cats during spontaneous and vestibular
              induced eye movements. Conduction velocities ranged from 13 to 70
              m/s and all motoneurons increased their discharge rates with
