  volume   =  81,
  number   =  6,
  pages    = "3007--3020",
  abstract = "The zebra finch forebrain song control nucleus RA (robust nucleus
              of the archistriatum) generates a phasic and temporally precise
              neural signal that drives vocal and respiratory motoneurons during
              singing. RA's output during singing predicts individual notes,
