              timing of visual stimuli can play a critical role in dynamic
              modulation of adult cortical function, perhaps through spike
              timing-dependent synaptic plasticity.",
  month    =  oct,
  year     =  2001
}

@ARTICLE{Fu2002-vt,
  title    = "Temporal specificity in the cortical plasticity of visual space
