              properties of layer 2/3 neurons and to mechanisms of visual
              perception.",
  month    =  mar,
  year     =  1997
}

@ARTICLE{Budd2001-yg,
  title    = "Local lateral connectivity of inhibitory clutch cells in layer 4
              of cat visual cortex (area 17)",
  author   = "Budd, Jm and Kisvarday, Zf",
  journal  = "Exp. Brain Res.",
  volume   =  140,
  number   =  2,
  pages    = "245--250",
  abstract = "To characterise spatially a major component of the anatomical
              basis of local lateral inhibition in layer 4 of cat visual cortex
              (area 17), we analysed the lateral distribution of neuronal somata
              postsynaptic to electrophysiologically characterised GABAergic
              clutch (basket) cell axons (CC1 and CC2). We report two main
