  volume   =  57,
  number   = "3-4",
  pages    = "513--528",
  abstract = "Histochemical, pathway tracing, and neuropeptide/neurotransmitter
              localization studies in birds, reptiles and mammals during the
              1970s and 80s clearly showed that the telencephalon in all
              amniotes consists of a prominent ventrally situated subpallial
