  volume   =  2,
  number   =  4,
  pages    = "415--23.",
  abstract = "Dopamine (DA) was applied to CA1 region pyramidal cells in slices
              of guinea pig hippocampus maintained in vitro in order to examine
              its electrophysiological effect on CNS neurons. DA induced
              hyperpolarization of membrane potential and an increased
              conductance in 75\% the 21 CA1 neurons to which it was applied. DA
