              flupenthixol and chlorpromazine. Extracellular or intracellular
              application of cyclic AMP mimicked the effects of DA. The results
              suggest that DA-induced hyperpolarization and conductance changes
              are mediated by a Ca2+-activated K+ conductance. DA may increase
