              identity of the group of cells firing the first n spikes and show
              how this simple generalization can overcome the detrimental effect
              of baseline firing. Thus, the tWTA can provide fast and accurate
              responses discriminating between a small number of alternatives.
              High accuracy in estimation of a continuous stimulus can be
              obtained using the n-tWTA.",
