              the discharge velocity. In both model and experiments, propagation
              occurs for AMPA synaptic coupling gAMPA above a certain threshold,
              at which the velocity is finite (non-zero). The discharge velocity
              grows linearly with the gAMPA for gAMPA much above the threshold.
