  author   = "Wang., X J",
  abstract = "In this work, we present a quantitative theory of temporal
              spike-frequency adaptation in cortical pyramidal cells. Our model
              pyramidal neuron has two-compartments (a ``soma'' and a
              ``dendrite'') with a voltage-gated Ca2+ conductance (gCa) and a
