  abstract = "The prevalence of coherent oscillations in various frequency
              ranges in the central nervous system raises the question of the
              mechanisms that synchronize large populations of neurons. We study
              synchronization in models of large networks of spiking neurons
              with random sparse connectivity. Synchrony occurs only when the
