              of inhibitory networks of integrate-and-fire (I\&F) neurons as a
              function of the intrinsic neuronal properties (e.g., the
              refractory period Tr), the synaptic time constants, and the
              strength of the external stimulus, Iext. The number Mc is found to
              be nonmonotonous with the strength of Iext. For Tr = 0, we
              estimate the minimum value of Mc over all the parameters of the
