  journal  = "Vis. Neurosci.",
  volume   =  16,
  number   =  2,
  pages    = "303--318",
  abstract = "We report results of numerical simulations for a model of
              generation of orientation selectivity in macaque striate cortex.
              In contrast to previous models, where the initial orientation bias
              is generated by convergent geniculate input to simple cells and
              subsequently sharpened by lateral circuits, our approach is based
              on anisotropic intracortical excitatory connections which provide
