  journal  = "J. Neurophysiol.",
  volume   =  78,
  number   =  6,
  pages    = "2985--2998",
  abstract = "We examined the patterns of joint kinematics and torques in two
              kinds of sagittal plane reaching movements. One consisted of
              movements from a fixed initial position with the arm partially
              outstretched, to different targets, equidistant from the initial
              position and located according to the hours of a clock. The other
