              of the ocular motor plant driven by such a pulse-slide-step
              combination. Saccades made after prolonged exposure to optically
              induced retinal image slip could also be simulated by properly
              adjusting the slide and step components.(ABSTRACT TRUNCATED AT 400
              WORDS)",
