  volume   =  142,
  number   =  4,
  pages    = "551--561",
  abstract = "Although the contribution of binocular vision to reach-to-grasp
              movements has been extensively studied, it has been largely
              ignored in locomotion. The aim of these studies was to explore the
              role of binocular vision during the approach phase and step over
