  author   = "Georgopoulos, A P and Kalaska, J F and Caminiti, R and Massey, J T",
  journal  = "J. Neurosci.",
  volume   =  2,
  number   =  11,
  pages    = "1527--1537",
  abstract = "The activity of single cells in the motor cortex was recorded
              while monkeys made arm movements in eight directions (at 45
              degrees intervals) in a two-dimensional apparatus. These movements
              started from the same point and were of the same amplitude. The
