  volume   =  202,
  number   = "Pt 12",
  pages    = "1603--1623",
  abstract = "Remarkable similarities in the vertical plane of forward motion
              exist among diverse legged runners. The effect of differences in
              posture may be reflected instead in maneuverability occurring in
              the horizontal plane. The maneuver we selected was turning during
