  volume   =  4,
  number   =  3,
  pages    = "374--391",
  abstract = "The authors draw together the results of a series of detailed
              computational studies and show how they are contributing to the
              development of a theory of hippocampal function. A new part of the
              theory introduced here is a quantitative analysis of how
              backprojections from the hippocampus to the neocortex could lead
