              modified synapses in backprojection pathways from the hippocampus
              to the cerebral neocortex, resulting in reinstatement of neuronal
              activity in association areas of the cerebral neocortex similar to
              that present during the original episode. The recalled information
              in the cerebral neocortex could then be used by the neocortex in
