              power of our proposal by showing that it can achieve high few-shot
              learning accuracy on natural visual concepts using both macaque
              inferotemporal cortex representations and deep neural network
              (DNN) models of these representations and can even learn novel
              visual concepts specified only through linguistic descriptors.
