  pages    = "2021.10.29.466499",
  abstract = "When animals explore spatial environments, their representations
              often fragment into multiple maps. What determines these map
              fragmentations, and can we predict where they will occur with
              simple principles? We pose the problem of fragmentation of an
              environment as one of (online) spatial clustering. Taking
