                   close enough to the target, which we term `reach'. By
                   computing the training phase diagram over a range of target
                   output amplitudes and periods, we verify that reach-limited
                   failures depend on the training algorithm while
                   stability-limited failures are invariant across different
                   algorithms. We leverage dynamical mean field theory (DMFT) to
